%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/diff_test.clj:25 (diff-test)
testing: Diff with removed keys
元の形: diff/diff の直接呼び出しを DW に書き換え
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import diff from dw::util::Diff
output application/json
---
diff({"a": 1, "b": 2}, {"a": 1})
%%% output application/json
{
  "matches": false,
  "diffs": [
    {
      "expected": "Object size is 1",
      "actual": "2",
      "path": "(root)"
    }
  ]
}
